WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Point shotfleet at your app builds.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.500
init reads the builds you already have:
an iOS .app and an Android .apk.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.000
It finds every language the app ships
and writes a config and a starter flow.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.500
For this demo: a prepared config
(iPhone and Android phone).

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.000
One English flow, every language,
iOS and Android.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.100
You maintain one flow; shotfleet
rewrites it for every language.
